oteinogenic building block of protein) … L-Carnitine (as the bio-active Acetyl form which is reported to cross the blood-barrier) and Ubiquinone (the energy carrier antioxidant form of CoQ10), as a direct means of promoting cellular activity, metabolism, and transport ... as well as both Glycerylphosphorylcholine and Phosphatidylcholine, for delivery of Choline to the brain (to support up-regulation of Acetylcholine, the neurotransmitter acting in both the PNS and CNS).*\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"BUILD-HD(TM) is the only BPI Sports anabolic formula of this nature.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BUILD-HD(TM) is a must have if you are looking to promote a stronger, bigger, and better looking physique.*"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Take one (1) serving (1 scoop) blended into 8oz of ice cold water, either before, during, or after workout, or as directed by a qualified healthcare practitioner. On non-training days, take one (1) serving (1 scoop) first thing in the morning, on an empty stomach, or as directed by a qualified healthcare practitioner."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warnings: Not intended for use by persons under age 18."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not exceed recommended dose."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Get the consent of a licensed physician before using this product, especially if you are taking medication, have a medical condition, you are pregnant, nursing or thinking about becoming pregnant."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP THIS PRODUCT AND ALL SUPPLEMENTS OUT OF THE REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"When combined with a proper exercise and nutrition regimen. Statements based on early-stage independent 3rd party in vivo and / or in vitro model scientific research data findings for individual ingredients."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*THESE STATEMENTS HAVE NOT BEEN EVALUATED BY THE FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION. THIS PRODUCT IS NOT INTENDED TO DIAGNOSE, TREAT, CURE, OR PREVENT ANY DISEASE."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"MUSCLE BUILDING PRO CREATINE*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"MAY PROMOTE:\nLEAN MUSCLE*  PERFORMANCE*  STRENGTH*"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"ZERO SUGAR"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural and Artificial Flavors"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"NO FILLERS - NO MALTODEXTRIN - ZERO SUGAR"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"Rev. 01-007-BHD001 02/14"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"-LEAN MUSCLE* - PERFORMANCE* - STRENGTH*"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"DO NOT USE BUILD-HD(TM) without first consulting your physician."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BUILD-HD(TM) is a Smart-based, Creatine enhanced powder formula aimed at increasing anabolic activity.*"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2015-03-25","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":49162,"description":null,"notes":"Creatine (Form: as Creatine Monohydrate) ","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":1,"operator":"=","quantity":3,"unit":"Gram(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[{"name":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","operator":null,"percent":null,"footnote":"Daily Value not establ